`benchmark.meta description: Scrolls a 3,000-block Markdown document in the WYSIWYG editor end to end and back by wheel steps, framing each step.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: gui,compile-timing

/gui/bench/fixtures/markdown-bench-fixture

. bench = MarkdownBench(markdown-bench-document(markdown-bench-sections), "Section 0")
. checksum = bench.sweep(markdown-bench-wheel-step)
bench.close()

-- "bench-result gui/markdown-scroll checksum=$checksum"
